Solution

Built a single, interactive Power BI dashboard connecting finance, sales, marketing, and supply chain data in one place
Created a dynamic Profit & Loss view that can be filtered instantly by customer, product, market, or time period
Added dedicated Sales and Marketing views showing profitability and growth for each customer and product side by side
Built a Supply Chain view tracking forecast accuracy and error, so risk areas are easy to spot
Designed the whole report to be self-serve, so anyone can explore the data without needing a separate report each time

Outcome

Replaced scattered, manual reporting with one consolidated dashboard covering the full business
Made it possible to check profit and loss for any customer, product, or time period in seconds instead of digging through multiple reports
Gave sales and marketing teams a clear, visual way to identify their most and least profitable customers and products
Gave the supply chain team visibility into forecast accuracy, helping flag high-risk areas earlier
Overall, turned a slow, fragmented reporting process into a fast, unified view for faster decision-making
